&lt;span class=&#34;token function&#34;&gt;tar&lt;/span&gt; xzvf nginx-1.20.2.tar.gz

&lt;span class=&#34;token builtin class-name&#34;&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; nginx-1.20.2

